# Example board written for testing (example_fixed_blocks_5x5); solvable by construction
# x = no block allowed, o = blocks allowed, A/B/C = fixed reflect/opaque/refract
GRID START
o o o o o
x o o o o
A o o B C
o o o x o
o o o o o
GRID STOP

A 3
B 1
C 1

# laser: x, y, vx, vy
L 1 8 1 -1

# points the laser must hit
P 2 5
P 2 7
P 3 6
P 3 10
P 4 7
